<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">2 Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Buṭ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nec ḏ Simƹan Buṭrus ḏ ijjen n ȓƹabḏ n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ arrasul nnes.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">
    <char style="it">Tsekkiɣ-d ṯabrat-a</char> i yinni iqebȓen nnefs n lʼiman am wenni iy neqbeȓ neccin s ṣṣulḥ nni n Arebbi ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Aḏaywem imarni arḍa ḏ ȓehna s waṭṭas minzi ṯessnem Arebbi ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mammec iǧa lʼiman n wenni iḏeffaren Arebbi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Aqa ṯizemmar nnes yuƹȓan ṯuca-aneɣ-d qaƹ min neḥḏaj ƹlaḥsab ṯuḏarṯ ḏ ṭṭaƹa nneɣ i Arebbi. Manaya minzi nessen wenni ḏaneɣ d iȓaɣan ɣar lƹaḍama nnes ḏ ṯuṣubḥant nnes. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin-a netta yuca-aneɣ-d lwuƹud nnes imɣaren ig isewwan aṭṭas. Ḥima s lwuƹud-a aḏ tcarcem ḏi ṭṭabiƹa n wenni yuƹȓan wami ṯarewȓem zi min ifennan ḏi ddunect-a ƹlaḥsab ccehawaṯ ṯiƹeffanin.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Fa x ssabab-a wanitan, ggeṯ lmejhud nwem marra bac aḏ tarnim min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ɣar lʼiman nwem; ssenni arnim ṯusna ak manaya iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />u ƹaweḏ arnim ȓeḥkam x yixef nwem ak ṯusna-ya nwem; u ƹaweḏ arnim ṭṭaƹa i Arebbi ak ȓeḥkam-a x yixef nwem; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />u ƹaweḏ arnim ȓxir jar wawmaṯen ak ṭṭaƹa-ya nwem i Arebbi; u ƹaweḏ arnim ȓemḥibbeṯ ak ȓxir-a nwem jar wawmaṯen.<verse eid="2PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Cuf, kenniw meȓa ḏaywem ṯimesȓayin-a aḏaysent ṯarennim, ataf aḏaywem yiȓi nnfaƹ aḏ tarwem ƹaweḏ ḏi ṯusna n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Qa wenni umi war ḏi ǧint ca ṯimesȓayin-a, ataf netta war itwiȓi ca mliḥ ɣar ȓeggwaj qa itwaḥsab ḏ aḏarɣaȓ ataf ƹaweḏ itettu belli Arebbi iɣfar-as ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes tuɣa igga zi qbeȓ.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Iḏen ay ayṯma, ggeṯ lmejhud nwem ktar ƹaḏ bac aḏ tḍemnem aȓaɣi nnes ɣarwem belli netta ixḍar-ikenniw. Meȓa ṯeggim ṯimesȓayin-a, ataf ƹemmarṣ aḏ d tewḍam. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ataf aḏawem twassewjeḏ ƹaweḏ ijjen n ṯewwarṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant ɣar ȓmulk nnes war ifennin ca n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus icehheḏ x min iẓra s ṯiṭṭawin nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Iḏen fa, akenniw sfekkareɣ ȓebda x ṯmesȓayin-a waxxa ṯessnem-ṯent kenniw mliḥ qa ṯbeddem x dsas n lḥaqiqa-ya iy ɣarwem ȓexxu. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Nec meȓa ƹaḏ qqimeɣ ddareɣ ḏi ddat inu, tḥessabeɣ-ṯ ḏ lwajib akenniw sfekkareɣ x manaya. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Qa ssneɣ belli ḏeɣya nec aḏ semḥeɣ ḏi ddat inu minzi ammu iy tuɣa ḏayi isefhem mliḥ zi qbeȓ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />U nec labud aḏ ggeɣ marra lmejhud inu bac aḏ tzemmarem aḏ tƹeqȓem menbaƹd x ṯmesȓayin-a xmi ɣa ffɣeɣ nec <char style="it">zi ddunect-a</char>.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Wa cuf, neccin tuɣa war nḏeffar ca ṯiḥuja nni iy twaggent s ȓefṭaneṯ n bnaḏem wami iy kenniw nsefham x jjheḏ nnes ḏ Nhar nni iy ḏi d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ; Lla, neccin neẓra s ṯiṭṭawin nneɣ mecḥaȓ ṯemɣar ṯuƹȓat nnes. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Ȓaḥeqqac Arebbi Babaṯneɣ isemɣar-iṯ yuca-as lƹaḍama wami ɣares d tenṭeq ṯmijja nni zi lƹaḍama yuƹȓan ṯenna-aneɣ: Qa ḏ wanita ḏ Mmi iƹizzen, nec farḥeɣ zzayes. <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Ṯmijja-ya iy ɣarneɣ d ineṭqen zeg ujenna nesȓa-yas neccin s yixef nneɣ wami tuɣa akiḏes ḏinni neǧa ḏeg uḏrar amqeddes. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Neccin ȓexxu ɣarneɣ awaȓen n lʼanbiya twaḍemmnen ktar <char style="it">zi min nefhem qbeȓ</char>. Aḏ teggem mliḥ meȓa teggem ḏaysen array nwem am i yijjen n nnur itceƹciƹen ḏeg yijjen n ṯaǧest aȓ d ɣa iṣbeḥ Nhar nni aḏ d igaƹƹeḏ Yiṯri n ȓefjar ḏeg wuȓawen nwem.<verse eid="2PE 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Min iǧan muhim qaƹ itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ tfehmem belli uȓa ḏ ijjen n wawaȓ zi lʼanbiya iy iǧan ḏi Lkitab, lʼaṣel nnes war d ikki ca zi min itfessaȓ bnaḏem. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Liʼanna awaȓen n lʼanbiya tuɣa ƹemmarṣ war teffiɣen ca zi lʼafkar nsen; Lla, niṯni ssawaȓen zi min ḏasen d itasen zi Arebbi mamc iy xasen d ihewwa Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Yinni itarran ixef nsen ḏ imseȓmaḏen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Iwa zi zic kkaren ca n lʼanbiya jar ccaƹb sneƹmiȓen waha. Amenni ƹaweḏ iy d ɣa kkaren can imseȓmaḏen jarawem zaƹma. S ṯnufra iṯarrasen-a aḏ siḏfen ttaƹlim n lbidaƹ jarawem ig isfennan waha. Aḏ nkaren waxxa ḏ Siḏiṯsen iy xasen ixeǧsen lfidya. Yina ḏeɣya tawin-d ȓefna x yixef nsen. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Aṭṭas iy ɣa iqellden ȓeqbaḥeṯ nsen. X ssabab-a wanitan iwḏan aḏ zebbȓen ḏeg ubriḏ n lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Ƹlaḥsab aƹeddis nsen aḏawem ccen ȓmux s wawaȓen iy tsayasen waha. Mecḥaȓ zeg wami lƹiqab nsen ƹaḏ itrajan-ṯen war iteṭṭeṣ ca.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Iwa cuf, qa Arebbi war iḥinn ca x lmalaʼikaṯ wami ṯ ƹṣant, iruḥ iqenn-iṯent s snaseȓ inḍar-iṯent ḏeg yijjen n ṯaǧest ḏ ṯabercant ḏi lʼaxira mani ɣa rajant Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />War iḥinn ca ƹaweḏ x ddunect-a n zman aqḏim wami xasen d isehwa ijjen n ṭṭufan n waman x yinni war ḏas itṭiƹin ca. Tuɣa iḥḍa ɣir Nuḥ wenni itbeccaren s ȓḥaqq ḏ yijjen n sebƹa akiḏes.<verse eid="2PE 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Iƹaqeb ƹaweḏ Arebbi ṯandint n Sadum ḏ ṯendint n Ƹamura issecmeḍ-iṯent yarri-ṯent ḏ ṯaƹejjajṯ n yiɣɣeḏ [=ṯnifesṯ] waha, iggi-ṯent ḏ lƹibra x min itrajan i yinni war ḏas itṭiƹin ca. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Isenjem Arebbi ɣir Luṭ netta ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem iy iǧan nican ṯesxeyyaq-iṯ ȓeqbaḥeṯ n lmufsidin. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Minzi aryaz-a itƹic jar lmufsidin nican, itett-iṯ wuȓ nnes kuȓ nhar ƹlaḥsab ȓefƹayeȓ nsen ṯiƹeffanin ḏ min itesȓa ḏ min itwaȓa.<verse eid="2PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ammu ƹaweḏ issen Arebbi aḏ isenjem yinni iy ḏas itṭaƹan zi ȓemḥayen iy xasen d itekken. Issen ƹaweḏ aḏ iqenn yinni iƹeṣṣan swadday lḥukem nnes ḥetta aȓ Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Xaṣṣatan yinni igguren ḏeg ubriḏ n ccehweṯ ig isexnizen bnaḏem ḏ yinni itseḥqaren ssulṭa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Iṯarrasen-a ḏaysen zƹameṯ n ttakebbur, war teggwḏen ca aḏ inin awaȓen war iḥȓin x lmexluqaṯ n ujenna. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Qa lmalaʼikaṯ waxxa ɣarsent jjheḏ ḏ ṯzemmar ktar zeg iṯarrasen-a, walakin tagint aṯen tahment s wawaȓen war iḥȓin zzaṯ i Mawlana. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Iṯarrasen-a niṯni qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin x ṯmesȓayin war fehhmen ca. Niṯni ggin am ȓuḥuc iqefȓen am lḥayawanaṯ iy iǧan s ṭṭabiƹa nsen iwƹaren. Xeȓqen-d iṯarrasen-a bac aḏ twaṭṭfen aḏ twanɣen mammec twaneqqen ȓuḥuc. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Aḏ txaȓasen ƹlaḥsab mamc ggin, aḏ twaḍarrmen mammec ḍarrmen niṯni iwḏan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Meȓa zehhun ḏi ṯfawṯ n uziȓ teḥsaben manaya ḏ aṣebḥan. Niṯni ḏ ixeciwen ḏ ȓƹibaṯ, zehhun s ccehweṯ nsen istwaɣarran xmi tmunsiwen akiḏwem. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ṯiṭṭawin nsen ɣir xezzarent ḏi zzna, war tjiwinent ca s ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. Niṯni tḥeǧaqen-d yinni war itejhiḏen ca ḏi lʼiman, uȓawen nsen trinaren ḏi ṭṭmaƹ. Niṯni ḏ ṯarwa n nnaƹȓeṯ.<verse eid="2PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ffɣen abriḏ nican weddaren, ṭṭfen abriḏ n <char style="it">nnabi</char> Balƹam mmis n Biƹur netta tuɣa iteƹjib-as txaȓus n ccarr. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Netta ṯenha-ṯ ṯeɣyuȓṯ nnes x ccarr nni; ṯaɣyuȓṯ nni ḏ ijjen n lḥayawan ḏ ṯazeyzunt ṯessiweȓ s yijjen n ṯmijja n bnaḏem ṯesbedd ṯubbuhȓiya nnes n nnabi nni.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Iṯarrasen-a niṯni ḏ ȓaƹnaṣeȓ bȓa yaman ḏ ṯayyuṯ iy ṯneddeh lƹaṣifa waha. Niṯni ṯetwassewjeḏ-asen ijjen n ṯaǧest ḏ ṯabercant aṭṭas. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Semɣaren ixef nsen s wawaȓen ixwan. S ȓeqbaḥeṯ nni n ccehweṯ n bnaḏem tḥeǧaqen-d yinni yallah ƹaḏ yarewwȓen zeg yiwḏan iy tƹicen ḏi lɣalaṭ. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ḍemmnen-asen iṯarrasen-a lḥurriya i yiwḏan walakin yina bab nsen netta ḏ ȓefna. Ȓaḥeqqac min iteḥkamen x bnaḏem netta ḏ bab nnes.<verse eid="2PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Cuf, iṯarrasen-a meȓa tuɣa ssnen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ arewȓen zi ȓewsex n ddunect-a ssenni ƹaweḏ ƹeqben-d ḥnunnḍen ḏayes iḏweȓ iḥekkem xasen, ataf aneggaru nsen iqseḥ ktar zeg umezwaru nsen. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Maƹlik tuɣa ƹemmarṣ war ssinen ca ȓuṣiyeṯ nni n ȓḥaqq iȓi ḥsen zi meȓa ssnen-t, ssenni semḥen ḏi ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ṯamqeddest iy ḏasen d immucen zi qbeȓ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Iwqeƹ ḏ ṣṣaḥ min iqqar lmiṯal: &lt;Aqzin iƹqeb-d aḏ icc min d inṣer&gt; niɣ &lt;Ṯiȓefṯ iƹummen ḏeg waman ṯeḏweȓ-d aḏ teḥnunneḍ ḏeg urwiḍ.&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ay imƹizzen inu, ṯabrat-a ḏ wis ṯnayen ȓexxu iy ḏawem d uriɣ. S ṯnayen iḏsent sfekkareɣ-kenniw tcejjaƹeɣ-kenniw s ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Xseɣ aḏ tƹeqȓem x wawaȓen nni tuɣa nnan ḏi zman lʼanbiya ṣṣaliḥin; <char style="it">xseɣ aḏ tƹeqȓem</char> ƹaweḏ x ȓuṣiyeṯ nni n Umsenjem nneɣ ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ iƹni ṯenni iy ḏawem d immucen s uqemmum n arrusul nwem.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Min iǧan muhim qaƹ? Itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ tfehmem belli ḏi ȓiyyam nni ineggura aḏ iȓin mujudin iwḏan iy iḍeḥḥcen xawem, aḏ ḍeḥcen aḏ ḏeffaren ccehawaṯ nsen u ṣafi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Aḏawem qqaren qa netta iwƹeḏ aḏ d iḏweȓ, hiwa mani iǧa? Qa zeg wami ṭṭṣen ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ṣṣaliḥin <char style="it">ḏi ȓmewṯ</char> qaƹ ṯimesȓayin-a ggurent mamc tuɣa ggurent wami d ṯexȓeq ddunect. <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Cuf, iwḏan-a ugin aḏ ƹeqȓen x yijjen n ȓḥajeṯ iy iǧan ḏ ṣṣaḥ iƹni ḏi zman nni aqḏim ixȓeq-d Arebbi ijennaṯen s ȓuṣiyeṯ nnes issufeɣ-d ddunect-a zeg waman inneḍ-as-d aman. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Menbaƹd isɣreq ddunect n ȓweqṯ nni s waman-a s yijjen n ṭṭufan imḥa-t. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ȓexxu ƹaweḏ s ȓuṣiyeṯ nnes twaxemmȓen ijennaṯen ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏi ȓweqṯ-a i ṯmessi, aqa twassewjaḏen i Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab aḏ sefnan yinni war itṭiƹin ca i Arebbi.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ay imƹizzen inu, war tettuṯ ca ṯamesȓayṯ-a: Siḏiṯneɣ iḥesseb ijjen n nhar am waȓaf n iseggwusa, iḥesseb aȓaf n iseggwusa am yijjen n nhar. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Siḏiṯneɣ war iḏqiȓ ca aḏ isexḏem lwaƹed nnes am mammec iy ḏasen itɣiȓ i yiwḏan. Lla, netta iṣebbar akiḏwem war ixes ca uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem aḏ ifna, irezzu marra iwḏan aḏ tuben.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Walakin Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ d yas am d yusa ijjen n uceffar. Uca ijennaṯen aḏ weddaren s yijjen n ssdaƹ ḏ ameqqran igga am ṯmessi isḥarraqen, ḏ marra iṯran ḏ ṯziri aḏ twascemḍen aḏ ftuttsen, aḏ texȓa ṯmurṯ-a ḏ marra min ḏayes itwaggen.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Meȓa amenni iy ɣa twamḥant marra ṯimesȓayin-a, mammec iy ɣa ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ nwem? Iwa u labud aḏ tƹicem s yijjen n ṯuḏarṯ ṯeṣfa aḏ ṭaƹem i Arebbi <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />xmi trajam i Lyuwm n Arebbi aṯ tseggurem bac ḏeɣya aḏ d yas. Nhar nni aḏ d yawi ȓefna n ijennaṯen s ṯmessi, aḏ twamḥan marra iṯran ḏ ṯziri aḏ fesyen xmi ɣa twascemḍen. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Walakin ƹlaḥsab lwaƹed nnes neccin netraja ijennaṯen n jḏiḏ ḏ yijjen n ddunect n jḏiḏ mani ɣa izḏeɣ ȓḥaqq.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />X manaya ay imƹizzen inu, xmi ɣa ṯrajam kenniw i ṯmesȓayin-a ggeṯ lmejhud nwem bac akenniw yaf akiḏes ḏi ȓehna bȓa ȓewsex bȓa ȓƹib. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Ḥesbem ṣṣbar n Siḏiṯneɣ netta am yijjen n ȓḥajeṯ iy kenniw isenjamen. Ḏ manaya iy ḏawem d yura umaṯneɣ iƹizzen Bulus s ȓefhameṯ iy ḏas d immucen. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Itari manaya ḏi marra ṯibraṯin nnes issawaȓ x ṯmesȓayin-a. Ḏi ṯebraṯin nnes ḏinni ca n ṯmesȓayin qesḥent aṯent ṯfehmem. Ṯimesȓayin nni sƹewwajen-ṯent can yiwḏan iqefȓen war tejhiḏen ca ḏi lʼiman nsen, wa amenni ƹaweḏ iy teggen i Lkutub nneɣni. Sxeddamen manaya i ȓefna nsen.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Iḏen ay imƹizzen inu, kenniw ṯessnem manaya, ḥḍaṯ ixef nwem bac war kenniw itawi ca lɣalaṭ n lmufsidin aḏ d tewḍam zi dsas nwem. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Lla, aḏ tmarnim ḏi arḍa ḏ ȓefhameṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen. Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama zi ȓexxu ḥetta aȓ Nhar nni war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ. Amin.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>